{"4109980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Riftwalker", "steam_appid": 4109980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/c7698fd27d1eed9d60e947e3d7c32738.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1080 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RIFTWALKER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gritty sci-fi bounty hunter RPG inspired by The Mandalorian, Dune, and Max Payne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track fugitives across lawless worlds where contracts pay well and mistakes get you killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden layer of reality that lets you bypass defenses, flank enemies, and hunt from impossible angles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/c23cfa318d4ce4ca40801ded5ee92b27.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/6a3351a9bee9f35204d4fa8b10504909.poster.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/6a3351a9bee9f35204d4fa8b10504909.webm?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/6a3351a9bee9f35204d4fa8b10504909.mp4?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/fbb63cbd4904bf4f52f6c47f01695e38.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take contracts across a dangerous star system and track criminals hiding in settlements, ruins, and syndicate strongholds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Track targets across multiple worlds<br>• Follow signals, clues, and last known locations<br>• Some fugitives run<br>• Some fugitives fight<br>• Some set traps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bounty is a hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/43a9b31a566b899dd5480752cf66dba0.poster.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/43a9b31a566b899dd5480752cf66dba0.webm?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/43a9b31a566b899dd5480752cf66dba0.mp4?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/54fad0c7a1619f0a6a59f6d51418e5a6.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast combat built around movement and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Slide and roll through incoming fire<br>• Aim down sights and strike with precision<br>• Deploy your drone for tactical support<br>• Hack defenses and turn security against your enemies<br>• Activate Void Time to slow the world and control the fight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the hunt turns violent, speed is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/e1e508fba4f9a7ac135fcfd1d2d9f6fd.poster.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/e1e508fba4f9a7ac135fcfd1d2d9f6fd.webm?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/e1e508fba4f9a7ac135fcfd1d2d9f6fd.mp4?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/75f468592877e8cf9c5977ece1178d60.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a hidden layer of reality that exists between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Bypass defenses and security systems<br>• Escape danger when the odds turn against you<br>• Strike enemies from impossible angles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But stay too long…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and something in the Void begins to notice.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/c5db46415281db65342e116f321ad1e2.poster.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/c5db46415281db65342e116f321ad1e2.webm?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/c5db46415281db65342e116f321ad1e2.mp4?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/73f1be0627cbed46c264be97a564dfbd.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy a tactical drone to gain the advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Scan enemies through walls<br>• Disable security systems and defenses<br>• Incapacitate targets with darts, gas bombs, and a high-voltage taser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track targets.<br>Control the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A smart hunter uses every tool available.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/eb6729a35c31ce0d0517165d6b818cc3.poster.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/eb6729a35c31ce0d0517165d6b818cc3.webm?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/eb6729a35c31ce0d0517165d6b818cc3.mp4?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/65416050e17ce6ee6c4c788f9d065759.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across dangerous worlds where settlements struggle to survival and syndicates rule from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Scavenge abandoned ruins<br>• Navigate hostile environments<br>• Discover hidden locations across the frontier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world has secrets.<br>And every world has someone worth hunting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/718b79cbcb6ff28bb5a2d2d8e3564530.poster.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/718b79cbcb6ff28bb5a2d2d8e3564530.webm?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/718b79cbcb6ff28bb5a2d2d8e3564530.mp4?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/60eb446de9c6a2a14c838d8fd0f8472c.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride hoverbikes across the frontier and chase fugitives through unforgiving terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cross dangerous landscapes at high speed<br>• Pursue targets across the open wilderness<br>• Reach locations far beyond the city walls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some bounties try to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s when the hunt really begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/688c55c99723081a78fbd80aa4f02cda.poster.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/688c55c99723081a78fbd80aa4f02cda.webm?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/688c55c99723081a78fbd80aa4f02cda.mp4?t=1778384083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/030df634bb708b2c7ff391bf22636fd3.avif?t=1778384083\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109980/extras/7791405358d8e2a198f97401cf07ba92